== Trivia ==
* The Siren originates from the Antibirth mod. Compared to the version in Repentance, two features were cut: one was a musical note projectile attack that reversed your controls, and the other was a revival mechanic that occured when The Siren charmed an extra life familiar like {{i|1up!}} or {{i|Dead Cat}}.
* She is based off of [[wikipedia:Siren (mythology)|Sirens]] from Greek mythology, which were dangerous creatures who lured nearby sailors with their enchanting music and singing voices.
* The Siren is the only boss that can interact with Isaac's collected items or familiars.
* The Siren's ring of tears and sinking in the ground attacks are references to the Gorgun boss from the game ''[[Wikipedia:Enter the Gungeon|Enter the Gungeon]]''. Moreover, both bosses leave behind remains that can be destroyed.
* The Siren [https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1496754922871615488 is voiced by] '''Carla Kihlstedt''', also known to be the voice of {{e|Mom}}.

